  "fullDescription": "123 Cozy Comfy Coloring book for adults;\n\nHappy Christmas Coloring Pages capture the joy and festivity of the holiday season with cheerful scenes, playful characters, and holiday-themed designs that kids will love to color. These pages are filled with elements that celebrate the magic and warmth of Christmas. Key features include:\n\nJolly Santa Claus: Santa delivering presents, waving, or preparing his sleigh, giving kids a chance to use vibrant reds, whites, and golds to bring him to life.\nCheerful Snowmen: Smiling snowmen with hats, scarves, and carrot noses, surrounded by snowy landscapes and playful winter elements.\nChristmas Trees: Decorated trees with ornaments, lights, and gifts underneath, offering a festive palette of greens, reds, and sparkles.\nCute Holiday Animals: Reindeer, penguins, polar bears, and bunnies dressed in festive attire like Santa hats and scarves, adding charm to each scene.\nHoliday Activities: Scenes of carolers singing, children playing in the snow, or families gathering to celebrate, filled with warm and happy details.\nFestive Decorations: Wreaths, stockings, candy canes, bells, and stars, perfect for kids to add their favorite holiday colors.\nMagical Moments: Santa flying across the night sky, Christmas villages covered in snow, and twinkling holiday lights creating a magical atmosphere.\nThese Happy Christmas Coloring Pages are ideal for celebrating the holiday season while encouraging creativity and spreading cheer. They provide kids with a fun way to engage in the spirit of Christmas, making each page a joyful experience to color.\n\nThis Interior Download Details:\n✅ Total 123 Coloring pages.\n✅ High resolution (300 DPI)\n✅ Size (8.5″ x 8.5″ Inch)\n✅123 File (Print ready)\n✅123 JPG Images File (300 DPI)\n✅123 PNG Images File(300 DPI)\n✅ Black and White\n✅1 EPS file\n\nBook Cover Details:\n✅20 Book Cover Images PNG file ( 300 dpi )\n✅ You can resize when you design\n\nNote: the quality of this picture 